OL,4,CRoad closed after bus crashes into pub 
OL,5,GA road has been closed after a coach   
OL,6,Gcrashed into a pub in a town in        
OL,7,GDerbyshire.                            
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said it was on the   
OL,10,Fscene of a crash in Butterley Hill,    
OL,11,FRipley, where a bus had struck The     
OL,12,FTalbot Taphouse.                       
OL,14,FThe collision has sent rubble and      
OL,15,Fdebris from the building into the road 
OL,16,Fand caused extensive damage to the     
OL,17,Ffront of the coach. Officers said one  
OL,18,Fperson was taken to hospital with      
OL,19,Finjuries not believed to be life-      
OL,20,Fthreatening or life-altering but there 
OL,21,Fhad been no reports of anyone else     
OL,22,Fbeing hurt.                       G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
