OL,4,CVan driver's lift helps officer catch  
OL,5,Cwanted thief                           
OL,6,GA lift from a van driver helped police 
OL,7,Gcatch a thief who was wanted for a     
OL,8,Gseries of shoplifting offences.        
OL,10,FPolice said officers were on patrol in 
OL,11,Fthe Woodthorpe area of Nottinghamshire 
OL,12,Fat about 12:30 GMT on 5 November when  
OL,13,Fthey spotted 34-year-old Arron         
OL,14,FPriestley riding a bike.               
OL,16,FThey started chasing him, but when a   
OL,17,Fpassing builder stopped and asked if   
OL,18,Fhe could assist, officer Steve Dennis  
OL,19,Fjumped in and continued his pursuit in 
OL,20,Fthe van.                               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
