OL,4,CUK's oldest living heart transplant    
OL,5,Crecipient dies                         
OL,6,GA man who was the UK's oldest living   
OL,7,Gheart transplant recipient has died    
OL,8,Gaged 95.                               
OL,10,FTed Warner was 59 when he received the 
OL,11,Ftransplant from an anonymous donor at  
OL,12,Fthe Papworth Hospital in               
OL,13,FCambridgeshire in 1990, and was only   
OL,14,Fexpected to live for eight more years. 
OL,16,FBut Warner lived for more than three   
OL,17,Fdecades before his death following a   
OL,18,Fshort illness on 7 November. Before    
OL,19,Fhis death, NHS officials confirmed he  
OL,20,Fwas the UK's oldest living heart       
OL,21,Ftransplant recipient and one of the    
OL,22,Foldest in the world.              G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
