OL,4,CCritical incident declared at two      
OL,5,Chospitals                              
OL,6,GTwo hospitals have declared a          
OL,7,G"critical incident" due to sustained   
OL,8,Gpressures, with priority being given   
OL,9,Gto the most serious cases.             
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals of                
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire said both Kettering   
OL,13,Fand Northampton General were impacted, 
OL,14,Fand the pressure meant some patients   
OL,15,Fwere "waiting longer than we would     
OL,16,Fwant for non-urgent treatment or a     
OL,17,Fbed".                                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
